{
  "$comment": "Required attributes per product category. Matched by category slug (case-insensitive). Each attribute: name (slug, rendered as a data-cim-* product attribute), label, type (text|number|url|color|image|rfa), required, optional default (pre-filled value), and optional disabled:true (shown but not editable — use with default to lock a fixed value). Type 'rfa' picks a .rfa file from the media library. CIM Revit plugin keys map by stripping 'data-cim-' and converting '-' to '_' (e.g. data-cim-tile-w -> tile_w). Units follow the CIM spec: tile_w/tile_h in cm; everything else numeric in the unit named in its label. Yes/no fields use text 'yes'/'no'. Component-tag fields are locked to the exact Paint/Tile System component name the plugin validates against.",
